    "insights": [
      "The palette adopts a digital brutalist, print-inspired aesthetic by relying on warm off-white 'paper' backgrounds and stark 'ink' typography.",
      "Rather than relying on varied background tints to divide content, the design uses a rigorous, blueprint-style border system to establish spatial hierarchy.",
